"body": {"content": [{"endIndex": 1, "sectionBreak": {"sectionStyle": {"columnSeparatorStyle": "NONE", "contentDirection": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "sectionType": "CONTINUOUS"}}}, {"endIndex": 9, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 9, "startIndex": 1, "textRun": {"content": "MISSION\n", "textStyle": {"bold": true, "fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 1}, {"endIndex": 29, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 29, "startIndex": 9, "textRun": {"content": "Qui est Fightxlife?\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "italic": true, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 9}, {"endIndex": 30, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 30, "startIndex": 29, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "italic": true, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 29}, {"endIndex": 199, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 199, "startIndex": 30, "textRun": {"content": "​​Le projet de Fightxlife est né d’une expérience de vie, un vécu, une histoire, celle de la fondatrice Rezki Sara touchée par le cancer à plusieurs moments de sa vie. \n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 30}, {"endIndex": 200, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 200, "startIndex": 199, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 199}, {"endIndex": 419, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 419, "startIndex": 200, "textRun": {"content": "Elle comprend très vite qu’elle doit se battre pour vivre et décide de mettre les gants pour faire  face à ce crabe pour se sentir vivante pour extérioriser la colère, cette boule au ventre et se sortir de l’isolement.\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 200}, {"endIndex": 420, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 420, "startIndex": 419, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 419}, {"endIndex": 623, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 454, "startIndex": 420, "textRun": {"content": "C’est à sa 4 ème récidive qu’elle ", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}, {"endIndex": 623, "startIndex": 454, "textRun": {"content": "poursuit l’ambition d’offrir aux personnes atteintes du cancer et d’autres maladies une aide et un soutien. Pour ce faire, elle décide de fonder l’ASBL « Fightxlife ». \n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 420}, {"endIndex": 624, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 624, "startIndex": 623, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 623}, {"endIndex": 997, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 997, "startIndex": 624, "textRun": {"content": "Un tel nom est évocateur de l’esprit de l’association. En effet, en s’inspirant de sa propre histoire, Sara R. propose d’offrir aux personnes atteintes d’un cancer des cours de boxe adaptée et d’expérimenter ce qu’elle-même a pu connaître à travers la boxe : avancer malgré la maladie, encaisser les coups de la vie, progresser dans le  combat et esquiver les coups dure. \n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 624}, {"endIndex": 1067, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 1067, "startIndex": 997, "textRun": {"content": "“Avance,encaisse,progresse et esquive” sont les mots clés de la Boxe \n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 997}, {"endIndex": 1068, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 1068, "startIndex": 1067, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "italic": true, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 1067}, {"endIndex": 1069, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 1069, "startIndex": 1068, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"}}, "startIndex": 1068}]},
